<title>USA: TABLE - Wisconsin Energy Corp Q2 net loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Wisconsin Energy Corp Q2 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.09   profit	 $0.41</p>
<p> Net	 loss	  10,632   profit	45,554</p>
<p> Revs		     403,214		  401,686</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 112,577		  110,819</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 results were hurt by expenses related to maintenance and repairs to Point Beach Nuclear Plant of about $0.24 a share. Additionally, Q2 1997 includes a one-time charge of $30.7 million pretax, $18.8 million after tax or $0.17 a share for the canceled merger between WEC and Northern States Power Co.  </p>
